# ── Contact form email notifications (optional, not yet wired up) ──
# Messages sent via /contact-us are always saved to the database and
# viewable under Admin → Messages. To additionally email the owner when
# a new message arrives, install a mailer (e.g. `npm install nodemailer`),
# fill in the values below, and send from backend/src/routes/contact.js.
# CONTACT_NOTIFY_EMAIL=
# SMTP_HOST=
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASS=
